space-y-4 text-center"><h3 class="break-words font-editorial text-mobile-h1 lg:text-h1"><a class="after:absolute after:inset-0 after:content-[''] focus-visible:outline-none support:hover:text-brand-red duration-300 transition-colors" href="https://time.com/article/2026/08/01/powerful-photos-show-a-surge-of-moroccan-migrants-crossing-into-spain/"><span>Powerful Photos Show a Surge of Moroccan Migrants Crossing Into Spain</span></a></h3><p class="rich-text font-graphik-compact text-caption-large lg:px-16">Close to 50,000 Moroccan migrants crossed into Spain's Ceuta enclave in just two days, creating a humanitarian emergency and leaving behind striking scenes along Europe's southern border.</p><p class="font-graphik-compact text-t4 text-grey-1">by <!-- -->T. Michelle Murphy</p></div></article></li><li class="col-span-full my-auto inline-grid size-full mb-4 lg:mb-0 lg:order-1 lg:col-span-3 lg:mt-12"><article class="relative text-black-coffee px-5 lg:px-0 [&amp;:has(:focus-visible):not(:has(.no-focus-on-parent:focus-visible)):not(:has(button:focus-visible))]:outline-black-coffee [&amp;:has(:focus-visible):not(:has(.no-focus-on-parent:focus-visible)):not(:has(button:focus-visible))]:outline [&amp;:has(:focus-visible):not(:has(.no-focus-on-parent:focus-visible)):not(:has(button:focus-visible))]:outline-2 [&amp;:has(:focus-visible):not(:has(.no-focus-on-parent:focus-visible)):not(:has(button:focus-visible))]:outline-offset-2 [&amp;:has(:focus-visible):not(:has(.no-focus-on-parent:focus-visible)):not(:has(button:focus-visible))]:shadow-focus-color" data-cslp="" data-cslp-field-type="Reference"><figure class="mb-4"><div class="relative flex size-full aspect-4/5 lg:aspect-1/1"><picture><source media="(max-width: 1024px)" srcset="https://static.time.com/v3/assets/bltea6093859af6183b/blt39000d9a1649cce9/6a6d07c4b9943418aea9d35a/Blanche-Pressure-Senate.jpg?branch=production&amp;width=96&amp;quality=75&amp;auto=webp&amp;crop=4:5 96w, https://static.time.com/v3/assets/bltea6093859a